# Conversation shell responsive presentation seam

This patch is deliberately generic: it keeps the official conversation store,
session lifecycle and model/permission APIs as the only business owners. It
moves the composer outside the transcript scrollport, exposes the existing
view state to compact presentation plugins, and makes model, permission and
context panels share the composer overlay. Product-specific compact actions
live in `@accrui/harness-ui-conversation-shell`.

